partialZipBrowser - https://github.com/tihmstar/partialZipBrowser
  Copyright (c) 2015 tihmstar
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSES/partialZipBrowser-LICENSE)
  ipswfetch re-implements the remote-ZIP browsing technique used by
  partialZipBrowser (reading the end-of-central-directory and central directory
  of a ZIP over HTTP Range requests, then downloading individual entries by
  range) as a self-contained Go implementation using only the standard library.
  No source code from partialZipBrowser or libfragmentzip is included in this
  project; the attribution is given because that tool's approach was used as a
  reference and to make the lineage explicit. The GNU LGPLv3 text is included
  in LICENSES/partialZipBrowser-LICENSE out of caution.

